sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant DB
    participant Broker

    rect rgb(255, 235, 238)
        Note over App,Broker: Dual write: the gap
        App->>DB: Save order
        DB-->>App: Committed
        App->>Broker: Publish OrderCreated
        Broker-->>App: Timeout / crash
        Note over App: Zombie: order exists, no event
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over App,Broker: Outbox: one local transaction
        App->>DB: BEGIN
        App->>DB: INSERT order
        App->>DB: INSERT outbox event
        App->>DB: COMMIT
        Note over DB: Relay publishes later
        DB->>Broker: OrderCreated
    end
